# Tiny RS / ROB / LSQ: issue must stall in order without losing instructions
Integer adder    1         2                              1
FP adder         1         3                              1
FP multiplier    1         6                              1
Load/store unit  2         1              4               1
ROB entries = 4
Issue width = 1
R1=0, F1=1.0, F2=2.0
Mem[0]=1.0, Mem[4]=2.0
Ld F3, 0(R1)
Ld F4, 4(R1)
Add.d F5, F3, F4
Mult.d F6, F5, F1
Sd F6, 8(R1)
Addi R2, R1, 7
Addi R3, R2, 7
Sub.d F7, F6, F2
Sd F7, 12(R1)
Mult.d F8, F7, F7
Add.d F9, F8, F8
Sd F9, 16(R1)
